# Admin platform safety

Production admins must **not** regain unattended paths that edit GitHub/main or bulk-mutate infrastructure unless explicitly requested:

- **Site Changes** / `SITE_AGENT_WEBHOOK_URL` / Cursor automation — gated by `SEAPS_ENABLE_SITE_CHANGE_REQUESTS` (default off). Do not re-enable in production without CEO + developer sign-off.
- **Aggregation import/sync/prune** from admin browser — gated by `SEAPS_ENABLE_ADMIN_AGGREGATION_CONTROL` (default off).

Public canonical domain is **https://www.seaps.asia** (`NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`). Do not default new links to `vps1.store`.

When adding new admin APIs, ask whether they change code, deploys, or global data; if yes, use the same env-gated pattern in `src/lib/admin-platform-safety.ts`.
